{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Ella Stars \u2013 As Featured on IGN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-rhythm gameplay meets original soundtracks, hand-drawn art, lovable characters, and epic boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/370cca546516aeb95fc4dcd5db453110.poster.avif?t=1770749563\" aria-label=\"See Ella battling a boss that looks like a DJ behind a giant speaker.\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/370cca546516aeb95fc4dcd5db453110.webm?t=1770749563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/370cca546516aeb95fc4dcd5db453110.mp4?t=1770749563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>30 Original Songs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ella and Bird have an origin story with 50+ million views on YouTube across 49 hilarious music-based animated episodes. <strong><i>Ella Stars</i></strong>\u00a0is basically a playable greatest hits album with hand-drawn art and intense boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bbd6404763f19a4416abaf06fd577f70.poster.avif?t=1770749563\" aria-label=\"A record player showing the game&#039;s song selection UI.\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bbd6404763f19a4416abaf06fd577f70.webm?t=1770749563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bbd6404763f19a4416abaf06fd577f70.mp4?t=1770749563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fourth-Wall-Breaking Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well not narratively, but you can crush each unique boss with a perfect combo at the end for a satisfying crescendo.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/cb60edb5ffeeea81e25abb101dd564c5.poster.avif?t=1770749563\" aria-label=\"Ella crushes a guitar-wielding boss against the screen, shattering it.\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/cb60edb5ffeeea81e25abb101dd564c5.webm?t=1770749563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/cb60edb5ffeeea81e25abb101dd564c5.mp4?t=1770749563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Crazy Hard to Kick Back &amp; Chill</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either keep it on easy with Ella to enjoy the great OST, or move through difficulty modes until the bosses break you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/91810975d34e699cc7bdb0af6db79e05.poster.avif?t=1770749563\" aria-label=\"Shows Ella in Fever mode, packed with color, speed, and gameplay enhancement.\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/91810975d34e699cc7bdb0af6db79e05.webm?t=1770749563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/91810975d34e699cc7bdb0af6db79e05.mp4?t=1770749563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let's Close This in Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, no journey of self-discovery and musical mayhem is complete without costumes to match your style. 11 unique skins to unlock for both Ella &amp; Bird.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bae38899c7de46da5324feb73d757015.poster.avif?t=1770749563\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bae38899c7de46da5324feb73d757015.webm?t=1770749563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/bae38899c7de46da5324feb73d757015.mp4?t=1770749563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cumulative Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3401870/79ae0f2d71128d6e19c8ce1190dcd4a2de77be71.jpg"},{"name":"Cumulative Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3401870/0100c0d2c640cd0a29ee2b83e046491c3aeb05c4.jpg"},{"name":"Cumulative Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3401870/4dbd8761c2e4ecd7d70dd39a2b5134a758cd966e.jpg"},{"name":"Cumulative Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3401870/55d58ba2f3992684a6b842409306ccbb1289466b.jpg"},{"name":"Cumulative Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3401870/d8e2faa0b4f194488956f8d6a440511a438133a5.jpg"},{"name":"First Login","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3401870/1ff2b5725174070a18ad9105fa3b2b9a97e5bd02.jpg"},{"name":"S Rank Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea